      },
      "message": "Open nostr: NIP-21 URIs as deep links on native builds\n\nRegister the nostr URL scheme in the iOS Info.plist and Android manifest, and route incoming nostr: URIs through getNostrIdentifierPath in DeepLinkHandler so the bech32 identifier resolves to its in-app route. The scheme is matched case-insensitively and normalized to lowercase before decoding.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "52d21ed606da0aedd3c3843ac8b2a49745da6a17",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/soapbox-pub/ditto/git/trees/52d21ed606da0aedd3c3843ac8b2a49745da6a17"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/soapbox-pub/ditto/git/commits/e5bde0a62c11da6ac2d0785089e2663241742307",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
