        "payload": "tree 52d21ed606da0aedd3c3843ac8b2a49745da6a17\nparent f8f51f2e0ccd190f71fabe822c76fabb79f2a5c2\nauthor Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1780146051 +0200\ncommitter Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1780146051 +0200\n\nOpen nostr: NIP-21 URIs as deep links on native builds\n\nRegister the nostr URL scheme in the iOS Info.plist and Android manifest, and route incoming nostr: URIs through getNostrIdentifierPath in DeepLinkHandler so the bech32 identifier resolves to its in-app route. The scheme is matched case-insensitively and normalized to lowercase before decoding.\n",
