        "date": "2026-05-30T09:56:06Z"
      },
      "message": "Add custom fee rate to wallet Send; stop showing fake 0 sat/vB\n\nWhen fee-rate fetching failed or hadn't loaded, the Send dialog's fee\npopover rendered every tier as \"0 sat/vB\" — a fabricated value, since\ngetFeeRates floors each tier to 1. The 0 came from a UI fallback that\nmasked an undefined query result.\n\n- Show loading/error status (with a Retry) instead of 0 sat/vB.\n- Add a \"Custom\" fee tier with an inline sat/vB input so users can\n  always specify a rate, including when the estimate API is down.\n- Disable Send when the resolved rate is < 1 and surface an inline\n  error explaining why.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "dd31f15531b17104b1dc7744f1d07e85c5d2d84c",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/soapbox-pub/ditto/git/trees/dd31f15531b17104b1dc7744f1d07e85c5d2d84c"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/soapbox-pub/ditto/git/commits/55d92aa9f4d0ec78e8bfadcf93b18f313aa0cbf2",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEESof9JJzQIzN3kpf4chHR+ZdE+7cFAmoatDYACgkQchHR+ZdE\n+7dwgg/8Ck8avXYHVNEdsbMyfTuFirfAhx+7Oz1bEDsDCKU+l1EDjtSWw6IEe5sk\ntcvdd5o2u5EZA7XfW9RDePgQlMAySeEbbJx3OQD9wavzFjJfgR4V1545av1hqMv6\nzDN5x/DeSbedeI1EZYirNtyVzFQj3k//8P1xWbEFnPOBkYOGUovoRCXmJxVWROVp\n0Zy3fj7ofcxxjJuctbCqkUOuraPctuegKh9PKXnmztf3pe80R6WWLLp4VQIKiW3b\nEw3ChRKZioRo3OrlDJ6D91NIy/mZRkBSVeXpam5qJfk/V1mTcsikuQqZCJ7rCtAH\nDTnso0y3MNDXZDpqTNi/IJy1TYSDPoJIYANBAPWmXzPfSfyt1cNfNngVA9ziPuaB\nvl6QoQDyA6dp3oh8DGVXt+SajPJnWzcscv+B9D02TB0UKoQdTfjmzorr4R9NDuIo\nkMZ1KXsVfz0XSOnrBB6bLDsSG0nAHeL8pieoP4JQh83JXtefZ/C3bcXQZNTuXbse\no0vsJAf4ag7ssOOlHeRCioaQZg+tCrJCEHSOJ6ZtQgUxJoE5btrQEu07/WVLSIZa\nKSW2bNcsv6RKssWbXcsPwG92q0voHCBsOoMtAqKBU5CLEk/PhGTSXQcKC1NFzV7k\nPggvQYKccYfY1gcnWVvQ5h9WzmIeGcEWVyL4lu6/J4s+CC6WAi0=\n=L2gL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----",
        "payload": "tree dd31f15531b17104b1dc7744f1d07e85c5d2d84c\nparent bcc318bc8cd043fadbfccf5b5a58a68b43de645b\nauthor Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1780134966 +0200\ncommitter Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1780134966 +0200\n\nAdd custom fee rate to wallet Send; stop showing fake 0 sat/vB\n\nWhen fee-rate fetching failed or hadn't loaded, the Send dialog's fee\npopover rendered every tier as \"0 sat/vB\" — a fabricated value, since\ngetFeeRates floors each tier to 1. The 0 came from a UI fallback that\nmasked an undefined query result.\n\n- Show loading/error status (with a Retry) instead of 0 sat/vB.\n- Add a \"Custom\" fee tier with an inline sat/vB input so users can\n  always specify a rate, including when the estimate API is down.\n- Disable Send when the resolved rate is < 1 and surface an inline\n  error explaining why.\n",
        "verified_at": "2026-05-30T10:05:08Z"
      }
